# Exclude specific URLs from lychee when they work in a browser but fail in CI.
# One regular expression per line. Add a comment saying why.
# https://lychee.cli.rs/recipes/excluding-links/

# Redirects to the Microsoft sign-in page (302), which lychee reports as an error
^https://account\.microsoft\.com/?$
# Unsplash answers bots with 401 Unauthorized
^https://unsplash\.com/?$
# Server sends an incomplete certificate chain. Browsers handle it, lychee doesn't
^https://citstudent\.lanecc\.edu/?$
# Works in a browser, but the TLS handshake fails from GitHub's runners
^https://www\.codeproject\.com/info/cpol10\.aspx$
# Sample url('image.jpg') inside a comment in the vendored WebSlides CSS, not a real link
/LectureNotes/static/css/image\.jpg$
# Placeholder form action in a form demo; it's never meant to be submitted
/Examples/demo_form_action\.asp$
